---
// Final CTA section encouraging adoption with tactile buttons and zero empty promises
---

<section class="section-space pt-0">
  <div class="container scroll-reveal">
    <div class="bg-[var(--forest)] text-[#ffffff] border-2 border-[var(--border-strong)] rounded-[var(--radius-lg)] p-8 md:p-14 shadow-[var(--shadow-lg)] relative overflow-hidden text-center">
      <!-- Background subtle grid pattern -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5 pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;"></div>

      <div class="relative max-w-2xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] bg-[#ffffff]/15 text-[var(--hl-olive)] border border-[#ffffff]/20 mb-4 inline-block">
          Modern &bullet; Taktil &bullet; Berkelanjutan
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#ffffff] tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4 font-['Bricolage_Grotesque']">
          Hadirkan Manajemen Pengajian yang Tertib, Rapi, dan Menenangkan
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--forest-light)] leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Ucapkan selamat tinggal pada buku absen basah dan lembar setoran yang tercecer. Berikan orang tua santri ketenangan hati dengan rekapitulasi capaian ngaji yang transparan dan siap cetak.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto">
          <a href="#demo" class="btn btn-lg bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] hover:bg-[#ffffff] border-2 border-[var(--border-strong)] w-full sm:w-auto font-bold shadow-[var(--shadow-md)]">
            Eksplorasi Simulasi Sekarang
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#fitur" class="btn btn-lg bg-transparent text-[#ffffff] hover:bg-[#ffffff]/10 border-2 border-[#ffffff]/40 w-full sm:w-auto font-semibold">
            Pelajari Spesifikasi Fitur
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[#ffffff]/15 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-xs text-[var(--forest-light)] font-medium">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[var(--hl-olive)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>PWA Layar Penuh Mandiri</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[var(--hl-olive)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Pencatatan Offline IndexedDB</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[var(--hl-olive)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Ekspor PDF A4 Landscape</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
